### Quick Test - Get Roles and Create User

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

### 1. Login as admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Copy access_token from response above and paste below
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 2. Get all roles (should work now)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Create user with roles
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser123",
  "email": "testuser123@company.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phoneNumber": "0987654321",
  "dateOfBirth": "1995-05-07",
  "gender": "Nam",
  "roleIds": [4]
}
